{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2022-06-06 14:00:00', 'title': 'COMERICA BANK ADDS TO RETAIL BANK LEADERSHIP TEAM', 'text': 'DALLAS , JUNE 6, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0COMERICA INCORPORATED (NYSE: CMA) ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF JAMES JOHNSON AS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, DIRECTOR, RETAIL RISK MANAGEMENT & OPERATIONS AND THERESA BAZAN AS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, DIRECTOR, SALES ENABLEMENT. BOTH WILL REPORT TO CASSANDRA MCKINNEY, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR, RETAIL BANK.'}